{"route":"/docs/4.6/about/brand/","version":"4.6","renderedVersion":"4.6","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Brand guidelines","level":1},"lead":{"id":"page--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<a href=\"https://github.com/twbs/bootstrap/blob/v4.6.2/site/content/docs/4.6/about/brand.md\">View on GitHub</a>"},"blocks":[{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Documentation and examples for Bootstrap’s logo and brand usage guidelines."},{"id":"content--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Have a need for Bootstrap’s brand resources? Great! We have only a few guidelines we follow, and in turn ask you to follow as well. These guidelines were inspired by MailChimp’s <a href=\"https://mailchimp.com/about/brand-assets/\">Brand Assets</a>."},{"id":"mark-and-logo","type":"heading","en":"Mark and logo","level":2},{"id":"mark-and-logo--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Use either the Bootstrap mark (a capital <strong>B</strong>) or the standard logo (just <strong>Bootstrap</strong>). It should always appear in San Francisco Display Semibold. <strong>Do not use the Twitter bird</strong> in association with Bootstrap."},{"id":"mark-and-logo--media-1","type":"media","html":"<img src=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/assets/brand/bootstrap-solid.svg\" alt=\"Bootstrap\" loading=\"lazy\">"},{"id":"mark-and-logo--media-2","type":"media","html":"<img src=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/assets/brand/bootstrap-outline.svg\" alt=\"Bootstrap\" loading=\"lazy\">"},{"id":"mark-and-logo--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Bootstrap"},{"id":"mark-and-logo--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"Bootstrap"},{"id":"download-mark","type":"heading","en":"Download mark","level":2},{"id":"download-mark--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Download the Bootstrap mark in one of three styles, each available as an SVG file. Right click, Save as."},{"id":"download-mark--media-1","type":"media","html":"<img src=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/assets/brand/bootstrap-solid.svg\" alt=\"Bootstrap\" loading=\"lazy\">"},{"id":"download-mark--media-2","type":"media","html":"<img src=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/assets/brand/bootstrap-outline.svg\" alt=\"Bootstrap\" loading=\"lazy\">"},{"id":"download-mark--media-3","type":"media","html":"<img src=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/assets/brand/bootstrap-punchout.svg\" alt=\"Bootstrap\" loading=\"lazy\">"},{"id":"name","type":"heading","en":"Name","level":2},{"id":"name--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"The project and framework should always be referred to as <strong>Bootstrap</strong>. No Twitter before it, no capital <em>s</em>, and no abbreviations except for one, a capital <strong>B</strong>."},{"id":"name--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Bootstrap\n    <strong>Right</strong>"},{"id":"name--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"BootStrap\n    <strong>Wrong</strong>"},{"id":"name--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":"Twitter Bootstrap\n    <strong>Wrong</strong>"},{"id":"colors","type":"heading","en":"Colors","level":2},{"id":"colors--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Our docs and branding use a handful of primary colors to differentiate what <em>is</em> Bootstrap from what <em>is in</em> Bootstrap. In other words, if it’s purple, it’s representative of Bootstrap."}],"demos":[],"nav":[{"en":"Getting started","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Layout","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/layout/overview/"},{"en":"Content","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/content/reboot/"},{"en":"Components","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/components/alerts/"},{"en":"Utilities","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/borders/"},{"en":"Extend","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/extend/approach/"},{"en":"Migration","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/migration/"},{"en":"About","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/about/overview/"},{"en":"Overview","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/about/overview/"},{"en":"Team","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/about/team/"},{"en":"Brand","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/about/brand/"},{"en":"License","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/about/license/"},{"en":"Translations","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/about/translations/"},{"en":"End of Life","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/end-of-life/"}],"standalone":false,"publishedAssets":[{"url":"/docs/4.6/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css","integrity":"sha384-xOolHFLEh07PJGoPkLv1IbcEPTNtaed2xpHsD9ESMhqIYd0nLMwNLD69Npy4HI+N"},{"url":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/jquery@3.5.1/dist/jquery.slim.min.js","integrity":"sha384-DfXdz2htPH0lsSSs5nCTpuj/zy4C+OGpamoFVy38MVBnE+IbbVYUew+OrCXaRkfj"},{"url":"/docs/4.6/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js","integrity":"sha384-Fy6S3B9q64WdZWQUiU+q4/2Lc9npb8tCaSX9FK7E8HnRr0Jz8D6OP9dO5Vg3Q9ct"}],"sourceScripts":["https://cdn.usefathom.com/script.js","https://www.google-analytics.com/analytics.js","https://cdn.carbonads.com/carbon.js?serve=CKYIKKJL&placement=getbootstrapcom&format=responsive","https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/jquery@3.5.1/dist/jquery.slim.min.js","https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js","https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/docsearch.js@2/dist/cdn/docsearch.min.js","https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/assets/js/docs.min.js"],"sourceStyles":["https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css","https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/docsearch.js@2/dist/cdn/docsearch.min.css","https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/assets/css/docs.css"]}
